    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσψηφ-ίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτιψᾱφ-</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
			3.674<i>A</i>18
		</span></i>(Rhodes, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vote besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ εἴργεσθαι τῆς ἀγορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.24
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καίσαρι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενταετίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					2.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				37.31
			</span></i>, etc.: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν σύγκλητον ὀμόσαι πᾶσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεψηφίσθη</span>
			<i>it was also voted</i>, c. acc. et inf., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				56.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προσεψηφισμένα, τὰ
				προσψηφισθησόμενα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Magn.</u>
				92b
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				101.89
			</span></i>.</div>
